ross columns\n- **Retry logic** handles initial connection failures\n\n### Key Features\n- **Fractional position ordering** for cheap inserts without full re-indexing\n- **Atomic transactions** for cross-column moves (card never in two columns)\n- **Position collision detection** with automatic renormalization\n- **Concurrent edit convergence** via server-authoritative ordering + full state sync\n- **`npm run dev`** starts both servers with `wait-on` ensuring backend is ready before frontend connects"})
